================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY CONTENT
================================================================================

This repository contains no text reproduced from clinical practice guidelines,
GeneReviews, or other copyrighted clinical sources.

The curated gene index records factual identifiers only — gene symbols,
syndrome names, care-domain labels, source citations, and URLs. It deliberately
excludes screening ages, screening intervals, imaging modalities, and drug
doses. Those must be retrieved from the cited source at point of use and
stamped with a retrieval date.

That exclusion exists for clinical safety: guideline specifics drift between
versions, and a stale number is worse than no number because users act on it.
It has the secondary effect of keeping this repository clear of third-party
copyright. Please preserve it. Do not paste surveillance tables, screening
schedules, or guideline excerpts into the index or the reference files.

All referenced guidelines, databases, and publications remain the property of
their respective publishers and are cited, not reproduced.